R_TP\"\n	},\n	\"nodeVersion\":1\n}\n2025-09-22 13:15:07.760 - 输入数据量为：45\n2025-09-22 13:15:09.284 - 部分数据：\n+----------+----------+-----------+---------------------+---------------------+---------------------+\n|basin_code|stat_month|station_cnt|avg_level            |max_level            |min_level            |\n+----------+----------+-----------+---------------------+---------------------+---------------------+\n|Unknown   |2025-01   |1          |87.990000000000000000|87.990000000000000000|87.990000000000000000|\n|CH        |2025-01   |6          |75.918000000000000000|98.910000000000000000|56.400000000000000000|\n|HN        |2025-01   |6          |83.039000000000000000|87.367000000000000000|70.219000000000000000|\n|PR        |2025-01   |6          |80.301000000000000000|91.874000000000000000|64.934000000000000000|\n|SH        |2025-01   |1          |64.252000000000000000|64.252000000000000000|64.252000000000000000|\n|Unknown   |2025-02   |1          |65.903000000000000000|65.903000000000000000|65.903000000000000000|\n|CH        |2025-02   |6          |77.294000000000000000|95.673000000000000000|54.269000000000000000|\n|HN        |2025-02   |6          |73.698000000000000000|92.456000000000000000|50.363000000000000000|\n|PR        |2025-02   |6          |72.026000000000000000|91.814000000000000000|52.110000000000000000|\n|SH        |2025-02   |1          |78.267000000000000000|78.267000000000000000|78.267000000000000000|\n+----------+----------+-----------+---------------------+---------------------+---------------------+\nonly showing top 10 rows\n2025-09-22 13:15:09.314 - 任务成功\n2025-09-22 13:15:09.328 - FINALIZE_SESSION\n', '1', '0', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 13:15:09', NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 13:15:09', NULL);
